---
import { DOCS_PATH } from "../lib/constants"
---

<section class="socratic-demo reveal">
  <div class="container socratic-grid">
    <div>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: left;">
        A guide, not a lecturer
      </h2>
      <p class="socratic-subtitle">
        Buddy doesn't hand you answers. It asks the right questions at the right
        time, guiding you to uncover concepts yourself — the way great teachers
        do.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
        <a href={DOCS_PATH} class="btn-secondary">How Socratic teaching works</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chat-mockup">
      <div class="chat-header">
        <div class="chat-user-info">
          <div class="chat-avatar">B</div>
          <div>
            <div class="chat-username">Buddy AI</div>
            <div class="chat-status-label">Socratic Tutor</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-status-dot"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-body">
        <div class="chat-bubble bubble-user">
          Can you explain photosynthesis to me? I have a biology quiz tomorrow.
        </div>
        <div class="chat-bubble bubble-buddy">
          Let's break it down! If plants require light to create their food,
          what specialized green pigment inside their leaves do you think gathers
          that sunlight?
        </div>
        <div class="chat-bubble bubble-user">Is that chlorophyll?</div>
        <div class="chat-bubble bubble-buddy">
          Precisely! Chlorophyll is key. Now, once it captures that solar energy,
          what ingredients from the environment does the leaf combine it with?
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-footer">
        <div class="chat-input-field">Type your reply...</div>
        <button class="chat-send-btn" aria-label="Send message">
          <svg
            width="14"
            height="14"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.5"
          >
            <line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line>
            <polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  /* === Socratic Showcase === */
  .socratic-demo {
    background-color: rgba(22, 19, 18, 0.25);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .socratic-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .socratic-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 450;
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    opacity: 0.88;
    max-width: 48ch;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-snug);
  }

  /* === Chat mockup === */
  .chat-mockup {
    background-color: rgba(22, 19, 18, 0.75);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .chat-header {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    padding: 14px var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .chat-user-info {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .chat-avatar {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .chat-username {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .chat-status-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .chat-status-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #10b981;
  }

  .chat-body {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .chat-bubble {
    max-width: 85%;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .bubble-buddy {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    align-self: flex-start;
    border-top-left-radius: 2px;
  }

  .bubble-user {
    background-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    color: #ffffff;
    align-self: flex-end;
    border-top-right-radius: 2px;
  }

  .chat-footer {
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .chat-input-field {
    flex-grow: 1;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .chat-send-btn {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    border: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #ffffff;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .socratic-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-8);
    }
  }
</style>
